{
 "title": "今天港股为什么开盘大跌？",
 "nick_name": "仓都加满",
 "author": "仓都加满",
 "user_name": "gh_e2899e9a812e",
 "desc": "买方深度骤降 70%",
 "content_noencode": "<section><span leaf=\"\">出去散步回来，突然发现<span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 41, 65);font-weight: bold;\">港股开盘大跌，恒生跌幅2.5%，就连汇丰银行这样的大蓝筹，今天也下跌了超4%。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: bold;\">一、</span></span></section><section style=\"text-align: center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/althONMKRxL9uSb3dO9Ikk1w7aTJqksxzFvgQssrDDG9ia4da7B6h0HuwzY9Dluiax0V0pkYibcANdCLMKW23jAbfwkV9EdWg4NocEkGkNbQCQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"1.0083333333333333\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1080\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"100034233\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section><section><span leaf=\"\">这是我关注的<span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 41, 65);font-weight: bold;\">几个港股大蓝筹公司，全部在下跌。</span></span></section><section style=\"text-align: center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/althONMKRxLfRQ6vZA7ibo7tTRxTBjCNGicdNt6092XW2vicTpZ6764ul7LQ4icPVC4RJCOKic1VKlXyvCRSccibNKTnmeibk0vicm3ibszLJqoJIlbo/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"1.0148148148148148\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1080\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"100034234\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section><section><span leaf=\"\">而<span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 41, 65);font-weight: bold;\">恒生科技指数，目前下跌2.8%，年内跌幅-25%，妥妥的熊市走势。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: bold;\">二、</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;mp-quote&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">发生了什么？</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-family:&quot;mp-quote&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;\">这几天A股休市，但是同期的美股、日股、韩股并没有大跌，10月以来美股纳斯达克微涨，韩国、日本涨了2%左右。</span></section><p><span leaf=\"\">个人觉得，可能原因在于港股的资金面承接问题，</span><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;,&quot;data-layout-id&quot;:null}]\">在</span><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;,&quot;data-layout-id&quot;:null}]\">国庆黄金周期间（10月1日–7日），<span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 41, 65);font-weight: bold;\">港股通（南向资金）全面暂停交易。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;,&quot;data-layout-id&quot;:null}]\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 41, 65);font-weight: bold;\">内资断流意味着买方深度骤降 70%。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">平时南向资金占全港股总成交的平均比例约为 25%–35%，但<span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 41, 65);font-weight: bold;\">在市场聚焦的核心资产中，内资的成交占比往往远超大盘平均水平：</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 41, 65);font-weight: bold;\">核心科技与红利标的（如部分中字头央企、高股息运营商、头部新经济股）：在平时的净买入和挂单中，南向资金通常占据其日均买盘的 50%–70% 以上，举例说小米、宁德时代、工商银行这些。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">当港股通暂停时，<span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">这类最具指标意义的个股买方盘口会瞬间失去最主要的主动买单提供者，下跌动力增大。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;,&quot;data-layout-id&quot;:null}]\">在亚洲交易时段，当国际对冲基金因中东地缘局势升级需要平抑亚太整体风险敞口时，日股有本币贬值对冲，而港币采用联系汇率制，没有汇率贬值缓冲垫，流动性又因假期骤减，成为全球对冲资金的做空目标。</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;,&quot;data-layout-id&quot;:null}]\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">三、</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">最后说一下个人观点，尽管港股机制存在缺陷，在特定领域依然具有不可替代的配置属性：</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;1、核心高股息（红利央企/国企）：</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">&nbsp;港股因常年折价，同类央企龙头（能源、通信、公用事业）的 AH 股溢价常年在 30%–50% 以上，对应港股实际股息率常年达到 6%–8% 甚至更高。只要企业现金流和分红稳定，离岸市场的流动性波动和急跌，反而提供了高股息的安全垫。</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;2、 周期底部的高弹性赔率：</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">&nbsp;港股在牛市初期或流动性宽松拐点时，由于平时沽空比例极高，一旦宏观预期反转，往往会爆发极为迅猛的“空头回补”行情，反弹烈度通常远高于 A 股。</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">但对普通人来说， 若追求稳健贝塔或省心持有：&nbsp;<span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 41, 65);font-weight: bold;\">全球配置中，美股宽基（如标普500/纳指）在流动性深度、机构长期买力及法制预期上更加平稳，长期持有的确定性要高于港股。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">另外，港股里面不少公司风险大，里面不少“仙股”和“妖股”，大量公司质地差、空有新概念，失去机构研究覆盖的中小盘股会被迅速“仙股化”或流动性边缘化，跌下去就可能永远涨不回来。</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">这些年不少港股散户损失惨重，所以尽量别追高吧，等散户知道一个港股公司的时候，一般就到头了。</span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: &quot;PingFang SC NEW&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;,&quot;data-layout-id&quot;:null}]\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 41, 65);font-weight: bold;\">最后，为了防失联，发一点自己想写的、真正有价值的市场观察，我最近开了个小号，欢迎去关注，机会难得！</span></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: &quot;PingFang SC NEW&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><br  /></span></p><section class=\"mp_profile_iframe_wrp\" nodeleaf=\"\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: &quot;PingFang SC NEW&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><mp-common-profile class=\"js_uneditable custom_select_card mp_profile_iframe js_wx_tap_highlight\" data-pluginname=\"mpprofile\" data-nickname=\"小仓仓观市\" data-index=\"0\" data-from=\"2\" data-headimg=\"http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Xic1vPEKPgo6wpiadia5LkJfKkf6gMeLyEk5A4zhRVHUMrCAfyWXtAibN3ofb2SxeIpgodiaUBiaklV3JiarZhicicYdgjSmjyRyLeicyUvib35Vy4tY14/300?wx_fmt=png&amp;wxfrom=19\" data-signature=\"二级🐶\" data-id=\"MzY5NTQ0Mzg0Ng==\" data-is_biz_ban=\"0\" data-origin_num=\"1\" data-biz_account_status=\"0\" data-service_type=\"1\" data-verify_status=\"0\"></mp-common-profile></section><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: &quot;PingFang SC NEW&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft